edb/ref 17592186427568 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427571 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "8f1bdcac-c8f7-5ea7-bb80-b176a1307c71" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427572 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186427571 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427572 #edb/ref 1069 "q-64708" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427572 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427572 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $y=y(t)$ satisfies the equation ${y}^{″}+3{y}^{′}-10y=0,$ which of the following **cannot** be $y(t)?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427572 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "128c4108-f47c-515a-aaac-ed93eb92e39c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427572 #edb/ref 1074 "Assuming $y={e}^{\\lambda t}$ and differentiating $y$ with respect to $t$ gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda t},\\,{y}^{″}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda t}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda t}+3\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda t}-10{e}^{\\lambda t} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda t}({\\lambda }^{2}+3\\lambda -10) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+3\\lambda -10 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation results in\n\n$$\n(\\lambda +5)(\\lambda -2)=0,\n$$\n\nand so the solutions of the auxiliary equation  are $\\lambda =-5$ or $\\lambda =2.$\n\nTherefore, any linear combination of the functions ${e}^{-5t}$ and ${e}^{2t}$ is a solution to the original differential equation. \n\nAmong the given options, only $-3{e}^{-5t}+2{e}^{-2t}$ is not a solution." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427573 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186427575 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427573 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2c217041-6e07-5b2b-ab0b-44e2beb8265c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427573 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186079206 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427574 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "90c0dd24-f5ff-5d53-a9db-2ea11550684f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427574 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186357470 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427575 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186427574 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427575 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b72723e4-6cca-52eb-af62-fa6496045372" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186427575 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186427572 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
